<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Short-Term Loan/Loan Application</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    width: 48%;
  }
  .full-width-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .full-width-row > div {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: left;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">SJSU BURSAR'S OFFICE</div>
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Short-Term Loan/ Loan Application</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">One Washington Square, San José, CA 95192-0138</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Section 1: Student Information</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Name (First and Last):</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">SJSU ID (9-digit number):</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="sjsu_id">{{ sjsu_id }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Local Address (Street, City, State, Zip):</td>
      <td><span data-field="local_address">{{ local_address }}</span></td>
      <td>Email:</td>
      <td><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Permanent Address (Street, City, State, Zip):</td>
      <td><span data-field="permanent_address">{{ permanent_address }}</span></td>
      <td>Local Phone Number:</td>
      <td><span data-field="local_phone_number">{{ local_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Birth date (MM/DD/YYYY):</td>
      <td><span data-field="birth_date">{{ birth_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Phone Number:</td>
      <td><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Please state your reason for request of loan:</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="loan_reason">{{ loan_reason }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Section 2: Reference Information</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Parent's Name (if parent is deceased, please provide another relative):</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="parent_name">{{ parent_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Address (Street, City, State, Zip):</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="parent_address">{{ parent_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Phone Number:</td>
      <td><span data-field="parent_phone_number">{{ parent_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Name of Second Reference (other than already listed):</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="second_reference_name">{{ second_reference_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Address (Street, City, State, Zip):</td>
      <td><span data-field="second_reference_address">{{ second_reference_address }}</span></td>
      <td>Phone Number:</td>
      <td><span data-field="second_reference_phone_number">{{ second_reference_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Section 3: Source of Repayment</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Name of Company:</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Address of Company (Street, City, State, Zip):</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="company_address">{{ company_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Work</td>
      <td>Name of Supervisor:</td>
      <td><span data-field="supervisor_name">{{ supervisor_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Phone Number:</td>
      <td><span data-field="supervisor_phone_number">{{ supervisor_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Financial Aid</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Other (please describe):</td>
      <td><span data-field="other_source_description">{{ other_source_description }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">For Office Use Only</div>

  <div class="section-heading">Short-Term Loan</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Loan Fund:</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="loan_fund">{{ loan_fund }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">BR Code:</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="br_code">{{ br_code }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Amount $</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="loan_amount">{{ loan_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Administrative Fee BR Code:</td>
      <td><span data-field="admin_fee_br_code">{{ admin_fee_br_code }}</span></td>
      <td>Amount $</td>
      <td><span data-field="admin_fee_amount">{{ admin_fee_amount }}</span></td>
      <td>Total Loan Amount $</td>
      <td><span data-field="total_loan_amount">{{ total_loan_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Repayment Schedule</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Beginning:</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="repayment_start_date">{{ repayment_start_date }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Amount $</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="repayment_amount">{{ repayment_amount }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Ending:</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="repayment_end_date">{{ repayment_end_date }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"># of Payments:</td>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="number_of_payments">{{ number_of_payments }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Approved by:</td>
      <td><span data-field="approved_by_name">{{ approved_by_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Date:</td>
      <td><span data-field="approval_date">{{ approval_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Bookstore Voucher</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Date:</td>
      <td><span data-field="voucher_date">{{ voucher_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Voucher #:</td>
      <td><span data-field="voucher_number">{{ voucher_number }}</span></td>
      <td>Amount $</td>
      <td><span data-field="voucher_amount">{{ voucher_amount }}</span></td>
      <td>Issued by:</td>
      <td><span data-field="issued_by">{{ issued_by }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">SJSU Bursar's Office</div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">Short-Term Loan/Textbook Voucher/Department Loan Application</div>

  <div class="section-heading">Agreement</div>
  <ol>
    <li>I understand that I have applied for a Short-Term Loan/Spartan Bookstore Voucher and agree to repay my debt on a timely basis as called for in the repayment agreement which was mutually agreed upon by me and my counselor.</li>
    <li>I will contact the Bursar's Office (Short-Term Loan) or the Spartan Bookstore (Bookstore Voucher) prior to the due date if I am unable to repay my Short-Term Loan for any reason.</li>
    <li>Failure to repay in accordance with the repayment schedule will result in a hold placed on my account which will prevent me from obtaining my academic records and any services from the University.</li>
    <li>If I fail to repay this debt, I understand that the University or its agent has the right to pursue collections in order to recover the debt to the University. If this debt is referred to a private collection agency, I am responsible for any collection costs.</li>
    <li>An Administrative Fee of <span data-field="admin_fee_amount_agreement">{{ admin_fee_amount_agreement }}</span> will be assessed if I pay after the due date of </li>
    <li>It is my responsibility to have read all of the information pertaining to this promissory note.</li>
    <li>I do understand, agree and accept that this debt is an educational loan and will survive any bankruptcy filing on my behalf and will not be discharged by any bankruptcy proceedings.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      Signature: _________________________
    </div>
    <div>
      Date: _________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 40px;">Receipt of Funds</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Funds received by (Print Name):</td>
      <td><span data-field="funds_received_by_name">{{ funds_received_by_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Signature:</td>
      <td>_________________________</td>
      <td>Date:</td>
      <td><span data-field="funds_received_date">{{ funds_received_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

</body>
</html>